    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable expended his own theft path dao marks to refine this gamble Gu. Gamble Gu gives random results that cannot be influenced by anyone. It has no offensive power by itself. The luck gamble killer move that uses it as the core is extremely dangerous. Because of that random characteristic, even Immortal Zombie Giant Sun’s luck cannot interfere with it, and the probability of winning is equal for both of them.",
        "chapters": [
          2201
        ],
